And President Trump and his donor, Postmaster
General Lewis Dejoy, they're talking about

00:02:59.190 --> 00:03:03.270
it like it's a business and it should be evaluated
and handled like a business that is supposed

00:03:03.270 --> 00:03:04.300
to turn a profit.

00:03:04.300 --> 00:03:06.010
That's not actually what it's supposed to
do.

00:03:06.010 --> 00:03:08.430
And I want to address that on the bonus show.

00:03:08.430 --> 00:03:12.570
We're also going to talk about the reality
